### 商家确认售后申请（同意）
PUT http://localhost:8081/shops/1/aftersales/123/confirm
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "confirm": true,
  "conclusion": "string",
  "type": 0
}

### 商家确认售后申请（拒绝）
PUT http://localhost:8080/shops/1/aftersales/456/confirm
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "action": "reject",
  "reason": "商品无质量问题，不支持无理由退货"
}